韬《CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路》一书。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">原文链接:<a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.yangyitao.com/books/cuda/chapters/19-nsight\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yangyitao.com/books/cuda/chapters/19-nsight</a><br>\n系列入口:<a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/README/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/README/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">大模型/CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路/README</a></p>\n</div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CUDA 算子工程：手写 FlashAttention v2 之路</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\"Premature optimization is the root of all evil — except in CUDA, where every cycle counts and the only sin is optimizing without a profiler.\"<br>\n——一句被 CUDA 团队改写过的 Knuth</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"两个工具的分工\" dir=\"auto\">两个工具的分工</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">NVIDIA 的 profiler 有两个：</p>\n<div class=\"mermaid\"><svg id=\"m4cf351633fbc4a6f\" width=\"3073.765625\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" class=\"flowchart\" height=\"145\" viewBox=\"0 0 3073.765625 145\" role=\"graphics-document document\" aria-roledescription=\"flowchart-v2\"><style>#m4cf351633fbc4a6f{font-family:var(--font-mermaid);font-size:16px;fill:#333;}@keyframes edge-animation-frame{from{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}@keyframes dash{to{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}#m4cf351633fbc4a6f .edge-animation-slow{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 50s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#m4cf351633fbc4a6f .edge-animation-fast{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 20s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#m4cf351633fbc4a6f .error-icon{fill:#552222;}#m4cf351633fbc4a6f .error-text{fill:#552222;stroke:#552222;}#m4cf351633fbc4a6f .edge-thickness